%N A082205 Palindromes pertaining to A082204.
%C A082205 Perhaps no digits other than 1,2 and 3 occur. From the second term onwards the periodic pattern of two 2's followed by a 3 holds.
%H A082205 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,0,1001,0,0,-1000).
%F A082205 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Jul 24 2026: (Start)
%F A082205 a(n) = 1001*a(n-3) - 1000*a(n-6) for n >= 8.
%F A082205 G.f.: x*(1 + 22*x + 232*x^2 + 2222*x^3 + 300*x^4 - 2000*x^6) / ((1 - x^3)*(1 - 1000*x^3)). (End)
%e A082205 The first six palindromes are: 1, 22, 232, 3223, 22322, 232232.
%t A082205 Join[{1},LinearRecurrence[{0, 0, 1001, 0, 0, -1000},{22, 232, 3223, 22322, 232232, 3223223},18]] (* _Ray Chandler_, Aug 25 2015 *)
